```

## 🔑 Key Differences: Deterministic vs Salted

| Aspect       | Deterministic (`encrypt`)   | Salted (`pgp_sym_encrypt`)   |
| ------------ | --------------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| Same input   | Same ciphertext             | Different ciphertext         |
| WHERE clause | ✅ Possible via hash        | ❌ Not possible              |
| Security     | Requires hash column        | Slightly more secure         |
| Use case     | Searchable PII              | Non-searchable secrets       |
| Function     | `encrypt(data, key, 'aes')` | `pgp_sym_encrypt(data, key)` |
